    "notes": [
      "Assembly comprises one plate and two separate formed supports. Only resolved item 1 features are executable. Unresolved placeholder geometry must not execute.",
      "Origin is the plate minimum corner. Complete assembly envelope origin and support transformations require resolved support geometry.",
      "D002 and D004 are insufficiently legible to certify the extraction; do not silently substitute symmetric baseline values.",
      "Transverse opening centering and square tapped-pattern symmetry are grounded in the drawn layout.",
      "Four assembly-drilled axes are separate from four support-foot holes. Do not borrow foot offsets for assembly-hole transverse positions.",
      "Rounded bends are covered by unresolved support features. No arbitrary bend radii or sharp-corner finished support geometry are authorized.",
      "All tapped holes are through, with cosmetic threads and null depth. No finite coincident cut depth is intended.",
      "D031 is in degrees; D039 is approximate blank length, not exact developed length.",
      "Material is 1018 mild steel. General tolerances: .0 \u00b1.100; .00 \u00b1.040; .000 \u00b1.010; angular \u00b11 degree. Confirm unstated lower deviation for 5.500 +.005.",
      "No welds, countersinks, counterbores, physical thread helices or sized edge breaks are specified."
